  "impact": {
    "memory": "Undo/Redo holds32 snapshots and100000 identities per stack, never images/PDF objects; desk64 sources/100000 original pages. Result rows format only requested25. Coordinator1, requests16/results4, selector32/6MiB, events32 and hidden-cache cleanup unchanged. Export retains native PDF objects;1000text fixture peak45.82MiB includes fixture creation, not large scan peak.",
    "cpu_ui": "One import/export worker and shared busy guard; Tk only reads immutable metadata/history. Pointer updates coalesce16ms and retain edge-scroll cancellation. Physical920x700 at100/125 tested, Tab reveals scrolled controls without timers; CtrlZ/Y support Thai virtual keys on canvas. Long reverse moves remain quadratic off Tk. Native insert/delete/save waits before cancellation.",
    "disk_startup": "No new runtime dependency or full-page raster loading; lazy registry and existing preview coordinator. Used source PDFs inserted once, unreferenced imports skipped. Stage beside output and reopen xrefs before exclusive publish. Read all source signatures again before publication. HDD/cold/frozen scan peak not measured.",
    "dependencies": "Existing PyMuPDF and CustomTkinter only; no new process, timer, library or font. Independent form names on imported PDFs use existing insert_pdf join_duplicates=False. App export concurrency remains one.",
    "output_quality": "Native text/vector/image, geometry/CropBox/rotation, links/bookmarks/annotations and independent editable forms verified. Deleted destinations removed, retained xrefs preserved. Poppler compares reordered and mixed exports. No quality reduction or rasterization. Imports are pages only; document-level attachments retained from primary only, signatures/scripts not guaranteed. Deletion is not redaction."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Windows10 development host16 logical CPUs; affinity2 does not certify physical2core/4GiB/HDD orWindows11",
    "Synthetic240/1000 text PDFs do not cover large scans/frozen/coldHDD peak; native calls finish before cancellation",
    "Before1.12.0 source idle2seconds versus1.13.0 idle5seconds; resource comparison limited",
    "No password/signature/script rewrite; imported document-level metadata/attachments excluded; deletion is not redaction"
  ],
